WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.300
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.890
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:43.800 --> 01:44.770
Yeah...

01:45.570 --> 01:46.970
The usual place.

01:47.070 --> 01:49.270
I should be able to
get there in like 10 minutes.

01:51.650 --> 01:56.350
Even though you say that, you're
always the one that comes later.

01:56.950 --> 01:59.220
What? I feel bad for your boyfriend.

01:59.290 --> 02:03.280
He denied Takiko's offer, right?
You have to value him.

02:05.430 --> 02:08.020
I know! Let's invite Masaki
and the others too!

02:08.100 --> 02:11.030
Then let's go hang out...

02:11.900 --> 02:12.670
...with...

02:12.670 --> 02:14.830
...with...
The number you have dialed...

02:14.900 --> 02:15.500
is no longer in use.

02:15.500 --> 02:16.670
...everybody...
...is no longer in use.

02:16.670 --> 02:19.540
Please check the
number and call back.

02:25.380 --> 02:26.540
Hey...

02:26.610 --> 02:28.410
Why are you crying?

02:30.020 --> 02:32.180
Why are you suffering?

02:33.190 --> 02:34.920
M-Megumi?

02:35.120 --> 02:36.890
Why are you lonely?

02:37.290 --> 02:39.920
Come on, let's go hang out!

02:39.990 --> 02:42.050
It's about 10 minutes past now!

02:42.630 --> 02:44.190
I got tired of waiting.

02:44.270 --> 02:46.060
Come on, let's go.

02:46.970 --> 02:47.960
Here...

02:48.340 --> 02:49.360
Come...

02:50.540 --> 02:51.560
...Yoshimi.

02:52.370 --> 02:53.170
Come...

02:56.940 --> 02:58.070
Yeah...

02:59.350 --> 03:02.280
No, don't pull me that much!

03:03.450 --> 03:04.350
Megumi!

03:05.190 --> 03:06.520
<i>Remorse</i>

03:06.520 --> 03:10.350
<i>Remorse
Episode 7</i>

03:12.390 --> 03:14.420
Brother, someone is here.

03:18.330 --> 03:20.100
They're really angry.

03:20.940 --> 03:22.200
He's really angry.

03:28.640 --> 03:29.540
Which way?

03:29.780 --> 03:31.370
Can you figure out where they are?

03:39.350 --> 03:40.180
Hey!

03:47.930 --> 03:49.490
Hey, get it together!

03:50.130 --> 03:50.900
Megumi?

03:50.900 --> 03:51.960
Megumi?
Snap out of it!

03:52.030 --> 03:53.300
Megumi isn't around anymore!

03:55.470 --> 03:56.800
You guys are...

03:57.100 --> 03:59.000
Why was I...

04:02.740 --> 04:04.900
No!

04:08.480 --> 04:10.210
It's mind control.

04:10.820 --> 04:12.410
They're leaving.
They're running away.

04:13.650 --> 04:15.120
Can you follow them, Naoya?

04:17.860 --> 04:20.190
No, I lost them already.

04:20.590 --> 04:22.150
They escaped, huh?

04:22.530 --> 04:25.160
This isn't an occurence of spirits.

04:25.230 --> 04:27.760
This is the work of
a living human being.

04:28.040 --> 04:29.940
The one who is causing
this is somewhere.

04:30.000 --> 04:32.670
Let's go around to the
ones that we can think of.

04:32.740 --> 04:34.040
Miss Yamashita?

04:34.680 --> 04:35.610
Yeah.

04:39.610 --> 04:41.480
W-Wait! Don't leave me!

04:42.550 --> 04:43.680
I'm scared.

04:53.860 --> 04:55.260
Are you okay now?

04:55.600 --> 04:56.490
Yeah.

04:56.560 --> 04:59.730
I'm sorry, I didn't want
to go back to my room.

04:59.830 --> 05:02.030
But why were you guys there?

05:02.170 --> 05:05.400
I thought the next person
that they would go after is you.

05:05.470 --> 05:07.630
They didn't die by
committing suicide?

05:07.710 --> 05:10.070
Why don't they try
to kill in their rooms?

05:10.140 --> 05:12.540
I'm sure the river bed
has some significance.

05:12.610 --> 05:14.580
Is there anything that
comes to your mind?

05:15.620 --> 05:17.050
There's nothing like that.

05:20.760 --> 05:23.220
This is Miss Yamashita's place!

05:23.620 --> 05:25.620
I'm going to go check
if she's there or not.

05:25.690 --> 05:26.590
Why!

05:26.930 --> 05:28.590
That teacher is a good person!

05:28.700 --> 05:30.490
Just what are you trying to research?

05:30.560 --> 05:33.530
We just want to know
who is causing all of this.

05:33.700 --> 05:36.190
Why are you suspicious of
such a good teacher like her?

05:36.270 --> 05:37.930
I don't understand.

05:38.210 --> 05:40.000
Put that on and the
two of you wait here.

05:40.070 --> 05:40.870
I'll be right back.

05:44.350 --> 05:45.780
H-Hey.

05:48.950 --> 05:52.180
Sorry. I don't like to
be touched by people.

05:52.820 --> 05:54.810
O-Okay...

05:56.790 --> 05:59.260
Are you guys
detectives or something?

06:00.160 --> 06:02.600
How did you find out
that it wasn't suicide?

06:02.930 --> 06:05.490
How can they do such
a horrible thing like this?

06:05.730 --> 06:08.030
We just want to know that too.

06:19.280 --> 06:20.840
She's not here, huh?

07:31.820 --> 07:33.810
I thought it was strange...

07:34.960 --> 07:37.360
When Masaki committed suicide...

07:37.420 --> 07:40.520
...Megumi was angry saying,
"The one that dies loses!"

07:41.860 --> 07:44.630
She was always
looking forward to living life...

07:44.700 --> 07:45.820
...but why...

07:46.930 --> 07:47.920
Brother.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.900
She wasn't there.

07:52.070 --> 07:54.230
Why are you suspicious of her?

07:55.740 --> 07:59.650
There was a picture of
the seven of you on the altar.

08:00.650 --> 08:01.740
Why?

08:01.880 --> 08:04.180
Did Miss Yamashita really...

08:05.120 --> 08:06.310
I don't know.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.620
That's it! Damn!

08:08.690 --> 08:09.750
Brother?

08:10.220 --> 08:12.320
Hurry and get in contact
with your friends!

08:12.430 --> 08:14.690
What? I didn't bring my cell phone.

08:14.760 --> 08:16.630
Who's the closest from here?

08:16.830 --> 08:18.060
Um...

08:19.170 --> 08:20.360
Yukio's house!

08:22.100 --> 08:23.000
Let's go!

08:36.920 --> 08:39.220
What is it this late?

08:39.850 --> 08:41.250
Y-You guys!

08:41.320 --> 08:43.150
First things first, your cell phone!

08:43.320 --> 08:44.290
Hurry!

08:45.360 --> 08:46.690
O-Okay...

08:50.900 --> 08:52.130
Hello, Yoji?

08:52.430 --> 08:53.200
Yeah...

08:53.270 --> 08:54.360
No, it's okay.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.540
Where are you right now?
Your house?

08:56.840 --> 08:59.270
Oh, then don't worry about it. See you.

08:59.340 --> 09:00.670
What about the other one?

09:05.610 --> 09:07.980
You will now be connected
to the voicemail service.

09:08.050 --> 09:09.350
After the tone...

09:09.680 --> 09:11.510
No good. Won't pick up.

09:12.850 --> 09:15.320
Let's go to the river bed.
That way's faster.

09:28.900 --> 09:29.960
Someone's there.

09:37.440 --> 09:38.910
Hey! Stop it!

09:42.420 --> 09:44.110
Wh-What is it?

09:44.920 --> 09:46.110
Takiko...

09:46.220 --> 09:48.090
What are you doing
at a time like this...

09:48.160 --> 09:50.620
On top of that,
this place is Megumi's...

09:57.330 --> 09:58.820
Are you okay, Naoya?

10:04.100 --> 10:06.370
This was where Megumi
was found dead.

10:07.610 --> 10:09.740
Why did Takiko bring flowers?

10:10.980 --> 10:14.740
She liked Miss Megumi.

10:16.850 --> 10:18.010
Liked...

10:18.320 --> 10:20.050
Liked her in what meaning?

10:20.550 --> 10:22.680
She started liking girls.

10:23.120 --> 10:26.650
She has no fixation to guys, so...

10:27.700 --> 10:30.100
...that's most likely why she
was able to go out with anyone.

10:30.760 --> 10:32.130
I don't understand.

10:32.300 --> 10:34.430
I don't understand that.

10:53.090 --> 10:55.560
Takuo!

11:06.270 --> 11:07.560
Did you hear?

11:07.630 --> 11:09.800
Apparently there was another suicide.

11:09.870 --> 11:11.340
You were able to walk
through the riverbed road.

11:11.410 --> 11:13.170
What? Someone
from that group again?

11:13.240 --> 11:14.710
Maybe they're cursed?

11:14.780 --> 11:16.610
Why is it the riverbed again?

11:16.680 --> 11:18.670
If it's not occult, then it's a cult?

11:18.750 --> 11:20.740
There were a lot of police officers.

11:20.810 --> 11:22.410
Could it be murder?

11:23.450 --> 11:25.850
Oh crap! We've got to get going now.

11:25.920 --> 11:27.110
It's going to start.

11:31.960 --> 11:34.620
The media are gone
till after school, huh?

11:34.700 --> 11:35.660
Brother...

11:48.980 --> 11:49.700
Let's go.

11:49.780 --> 11:50.970
Hold on, Brother.

11:57.950 --> 12:00.610
Those two were together till morning.

12:00.690 --> 12:02.920
Then it's not that teacher?

12:03.360 --> 12:07.380
She doesn't have that
strong power that I felt last night.

12:08.160 --> 12:10.190
Then what was with the pictures in her room?

12:10.260 --> 12:12.560
I don't know. I don't know, but...

12:16.600 --> 12:19.270
She's filled with sadness right now.

12:19.640 --> 12:21.440
She can't kill a person.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.410
Takuo...

12:29.480 --> 12:31.350
He died in place of me.

12:31.820 --> 12:34.520
I should have been the
one that was going to die.

12:34.590 --> 12:37.250
Why! Why would you
say such a thing?

12:37.720 --> 12:39.160
Mind control.

12:39.230 --> 12:40.190
What?

12:40.290 --> 12:43.160
They use the human's feelings
as its skill to manipulate.

12:43.230 --> 12:45.060
Is that a supernatural power?

12:45.130 --> 12:47.260
Yeah, it's a pretty strong power.

12:47.330 --> 12:50.770
Stop joking around!
There's no way such a thing exists!

12:50.840 --> 12:53.640
They increase the negativity and
make you think life is hopeless...

12:53.710 --> 12:55.680
...then they lure you
into committing suicide.

12:55.910 --> 12:57.600
There are 4 people dead already.

12:58.380 --> 12:59.970
No, they've been killed.

13:01.110 --> 13:04.480
If we stay like this, all of you are
going to be killed as time goes on.

13:04.590 --> 13:05.680
Are you serious...

13:05.750 --> 13:08.450
Yoshimi, what were
your feelings then?

13:09.220 --> 13:11.920
I slowly started feeling
like I wanted to die...

13:11.990 --> 13:14.830
...I started thinking even
if I am alive, it's boring.

13:14.900 --> 13:16.190
What the hell is that?

13:16.260 --> 13:19.360
I felt that it would be
much better for me to die.

13:19.800 --> 13:23.760
Then all of a sudden,
Megumi was standing behind me.

13:24.540 --> 13:25.730
Everyone else too...

13:29.880 --> 13:32.400
How am I supposed to
believe such a thing?

13:32.480 --> 13:36.880
I have no confidence in being able to
run from it if they do it to me again.

13:37.750 --> 13:40.550
Does that mean they're going to
make me commit suicide too?

13:40.620 --> 13:41.820
You've got to be kidding me!

13:43.320 --> 13:44.760
Why is it dawn then?

13:45.290 --> 13:49.990
It's a time that the brain isn't
fully awakened, so it's easy to get in.

13:50.060 --> 13:53.230
There are many humans that use
different powers and manipulate others...

13:53.300 --> 13:54.960
...in this world.

13:55.640 --> 13:59.470
It's not strange if there are
humans that are extremely strong.

13:59.740 --> 14:01.500
It was the power of a grudge.

14:01.680 --> 14:04.580
It's lurking around in
many parts of this town.

14:04.650 --> 14:08.780
It's really dark and dug in like
you can't do anything about it.

14:14.190 --> 14:17.680
Think about it really strongly.
Nothing comes to your mind?

14:17.960 --> 14:19.430
I don't know.

14:19.990 --> 14:22.550
A grudge strong enough to kill us...

14:22.630 --> 14:24.930
Nothing! Nothing comes to mind!

14:25.030 --> 14:28.400
Why did Miss Yamashita have
pictures of you guys at her house?

14:28.900 --> 14:31.770
We were on good terms
with that teacher.

14:31.970 --> 14:35.700
But she shouldn't have known that
the seven of us hung out all the time.

14:35.780 --> 14:37.270
She knows that.

14:38.180 --> 14:39.740
Taguchi told her.

14:40.050 --> 14:42.280
Like about the time we all
went to the beach together.

14:42.350 --> 14:43.510
When was that?

14:44.080 --> 14:45.680
About 2 months ago.

14:45.950 --> 14:48.750
Apparently she had
interest and asked him.

14:48.990 --> 14:52.250
But Miss Yamashita
isn't one to blame, right?

15:07.170 --> 15:08.730
Wh-Who is it?

15:12.050 --> 15:13.540
Miss Yamashita!

15:13.850 --> 15:16.010
Terrible things have happened and...

15:16.080 --> 15:18.380
...I was worried how
you guys were doing.

15:18.950 --> 15:20.980
Are you all okay?

15:21.890 --> 15:23.320
Miss Yamashita...

15:25.260 --> 15:26.620
Miss Yoshimi...

15:26.790 --> 15:28.190
You poor thing...

15:29.630 --> 15:33.570
No, you shouldn't listen to
what those weird men say.

15:33.700 --> 15:34.890
You cannot.

15:35.370 --> 15:41.170
I spent time researching the
seven of you by using this woman.

15:42.110 --> 15:44.630
I have to get rid of you all.

15:48.220 --> 15:49.270
Stop it!

15:56.090 --> 15:57.390
Wh-What is it?

16:03.760 --> 16:04.730
How is she?

16:04.900 --> 16:05.920
She's fine.

16:06.270 --> 16:08.200
She was being manipulated.

16:08.770 --> 16:09.900
Is it still here?

16:10.000 --> 16:12.130
No. I don't know.

16:15.610 --> 16:17.240
I remember now.

16:17.310 --> 16:18.680
It was that...

16:19.410 --> 16:24.040
When we were on our way back
from the beach on our bikes.

16:25.590 --> 16:26.950
It's that spot...

16:27.020 --> 16:27.920
That river bed...

16:29.320 --> 16:31.380
We should have gone back!

16:31.460 --> 16:34.290
If we went back and checked
then we wouldn't have...

16:37.860 --> 16:39.530
Did you just hit something?

16:39.600 --> 16:41.860
I don't care! It's most
likely a dog or cat, right?

16:41.940 --> 16:43.460
You're not going to go check?

16:43.570 --> 16:45.400
It's most likely thrown somewhere!

16:48.780 --> 16:49.900
No!

16:50.110 --> 16:51.740
I don't want something like this!

16:51.810 --> 16:53.640
Help! I'm scared!

16:53.780 --> 16:55.440
I can't keep going on like this!

16:57.820 --> 17:00.010
Hey! If you stay together, you'll be fine!

17:00.090 --> 17:01.380
Get it together!

17:02.590 --> 17:05.750
What is this? It's like my
blood is counter-currenting.

17:10.630 --> 17:12.960
Did my power go on a rampage?

17:14.100 --> 17:15.970
There's no way.

17:22.510 --> 17:25.600
I destroyed everything.

17:26.910 --> 17:28.350
Everything!

17:30.150 --> 17:31.310
Brother...

17:31.490 --> 17:32.920
I can't...

17:33.190 --> 17:34.780
I can't anymore...

17:35.360 --> 17:38.050
I'm just going to be a burden.

17:38.260 --> 17:39.590
I can't do anything.

17:40.160 --> 17:41.150
Naoya...

17:41.460 --> 17:42.930
For me to be alive...

17:43.230 --> 17:45.460
It was a mistake for me to be born!

17:46.470 --> 17:47.520
Naoya...

17:48.670 --> 17:51.360
I'd be better off not being here!

17:51.610 --> 17:53.940
There's no reason for me to be alive!

17:54.910 --> 17:56.710
They have entered his heart!

17:56.940 --> 17:57.880
Damn it!

17:58.610 --> 17:59.440
Naoya!

17:59.510 --> 18:00.640
Get it together!

18:00.710 --> 18:01.650
Naoya!

18:01.750 --> 18:04.770
There's no life that shouldn't be born!

18:05.290 --> 18:07.520
Have more confidence
in yourself and live, Naoya!

18:08.020 --> 18:09.420
I'll protect you!

18:09.890 --> 18:10.880
Naoya...

18:15.260 --> 18:16.490
Brother...

18:18.570 --> 18:20.360
Are you okay, Naoya?

18:20.470 --> 18:22.160
Thank you, Brother.

18:29.810 --> 18:31.000
Get it together.

18:31.080 --> 18:33.050
I... again?

18:33.380 --> 18:34.240
I...

18:34.550 --> 18:35.880
...have to die...

18:35.950 --> 18:37.080
I can die...

18:38.450 --> 18:40.980
I don't want to stay alive anymore.

18:46.990 --> 18:49.120
You're okay now, right?

18:49.200 --> 18:50.160
Y-Yeah...

18:50.230 --> 18:51.360
Brother!

18:51.630 --> 18:53.330
He's still close.

18:53.500 --> 18:55.260
His waves are being
transmitted to me.

18:55.500 --> 18:57.440
He's trying to escape right now.

18:57.870 --> 18:59.430
I've got him this time!

18:59.870 --> 19:01.430
Okay, let's go after him!

19:01.780 --> 19:03.610
Please take care of those two.

19:03.710 --> 19:05.270
Y-Yeah. U-Um...

19:06.150 --> 19:07.740
Please be careful.

19:18.730 --> 19:19.890
Is that the place?

19:19.960 --> 19:20.860
Yeah.

19:27.470 --> 19:28.830
Wh-Who are you?

19:29.470 --> 19:31.730
It's there in the back room.

19:33.110 --> 19:35.770
Let us see the person
that's in the back over there.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.230
What?

19:37.410 --> 19:39.210
What's up with you guys?

19:45.690 --> 19:46.910
W-Wait!

19:51.020 --> 19:52.690
You knew!

19:52.830 --> 19:55.060
You knew, but you just let it go!

19:55.960 --> 19:58.860
Wh-Why do you know?

19:59.000 --> 20:00.430
But... I mean...

20:00.630 --> 20:03.870
It's better for the world for
that biker gang to be dead!

20:04.000 --> 20:05.130
Aren't I right?

20:05.770 --> 20:07.330
He didn't do anything!

20:07.410 --> 20:08.470
Nothing!

20:08.680 --> 20:10.910
Not even one bad thing!

20:11.040 --> 20:14.310
He just... just thought of it in his heart!

20:14.510 --> 20:16.140
It's just that!

20:24.920 --> 20:25.890
Come out.

20:30.760 --> 20:32.060
Those guys...

20:32.300 --> 20:33.630
...killed...

20:33.800 --> 20:34.630
...my dog.

20:36.870 --> 20:40.070
They hit and killed
my dog as they escaped.

20:44.040 --> 20:45.770
He was my friend.

20:46.580 --> 20:48.070
I loved him.

20:49.880 --> 20:51.080
Those guys...

20:52.050 --> 20:54.450
Don't say anything. Please...

20:54.920 --> 20:56.650
It shouldn't be considered a crime.

20:56.990 --> 20:58.620
We should contact Mikuriya.

20:58.990 --> 20:59.920
Yeah...

21:00.130 --> 21:02.320
What? What are you going to do?

21:02.600 --> 21:06.330
I think it's the best for him to be put
in custody of a guy named Mikuriya.

21:06.400 --> 21:07.300
Put in custody?

21:07.370 --> 21:08.800
What do you mean by put in custody!

21:08.870 --> 21:10.630
I won't let him go anywhere!

21:10.700 --> 21:13.670
I won't... I won't let
something like that happen.

21:14.370 --> 21:17.610
Are you fine with letting
this boy kill more people?

21:20.880 --> 21:22.440
He's kind...

21:22.880 --> 21:25.480
He's a kind and good child...

21:25.790 --> 21:29.740
It's just that the people in
this world didn't leave him alone.

21:30.460 --> 21:31.520
Isn't that right?

21:31.590 --> 21:33.120
Poor thing...

21:34.760 --> 21:39.220
There are moments everyone
thinks that someone should die.

21:39.530 --> 21:42.400
If you're human, everyone thinks that.

21:42.670 --> 21:45.070
But they don't have
powers like this child...

21:45.140 --> 21:47.440
...so they're able to live a normal life.

21:48.980 --> 21:50.240
Isn't that right?

22:01.390 --> 22:02.480
Brother!

22:23.810 --> 22:25.510
It's that girl...

22:29.920 --> 22:38.720
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.410
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.480 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.290 --> 23:09.620
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.690 --> 23:13.990
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.060 --> 23:18.430
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.500 --> 23:22.940
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.170 --> 23:27.270
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:31.900
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.980 --> 23:42.080
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.720 --> 23:51.460
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.530 --> 23:59.910
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:01.140 --> 24:03.370
The darkness that
will destroy the light...

24:03.440 --> 24:06.070
...appears with an evil grin upon it.

24:06.750 --> 24:10.240
The girl of guidance who
disappeared into the dictionary.

24:11.850 --> 24:14.080
Mysteries that come
wrapping around repeatedly.

24:14.850 --> 24:18.020
To our hearts that have
wandered the infinite maze...

24:18.530 --> 24:21.960
...words of fabrication
drop a dark shadow.

24:23.300 --> 24:29.870
<i>Episode 8, "Recollection."</i>

24:25.900 --> 24:28.900
Where are we headed?
